  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundraising relay in Lesvos : running 320km in 32h</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The challenge is the following : 320 km. 32 hours. 20 runners. Raise 1.000.  Together, as members of Yoga and Sport with Refugees, we have set ourselves this challenge to raise money to support the YSR project in Lesvos. Our NGO focuses on improving the physical and mental wellbeing of refugees through sport, working towards integration and building a community. We currently facilitate 500 students per week - with your support, we can continue to offer a healthy and safe space to refugees.</narrative>
  </description>
